WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Ryu blocks the standing MP opener.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.800
Marisa guards the recorded Ryu OD Shoryuken.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.550
Held standing HP punishes the reversal recovery.

4
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.750
Forward HK cancels into the first Rush extension.

5
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.800
The second Rush cancel spends the remaining Drive and enters Burnout.

6
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.050
Heavy Dimachaerus and its follow-up launch Ryu.

7
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:14.050
Heavy Gladius cancels into Level 3.

8
00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:14.600
Level 3 leaves Ryu knocked down.
